  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (HA-08B, HA-09B, HA-10B, Existing 01, Existing 02 (received 24/10/2013)\nProposed 01, Proposed 02 (received 18/02/2014)) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The extension permitted under application 00560/12/P5 shall not be implemented unless there is an agreement under section 106 to prohibit the implementation of this permission (00560/12/P6).",
    "Condition : 4 - The property shall not contain more than 7 residents (including caretaker/landlord) at any one time.",
    "Condition : 5 - Full details of bin storage to be submitted and approved prior to commencement of works.  The bin storage shall be implemented in accordance with the approved details prior to the commencement of the development and retained in that form for as long as the development remains in existence.",
    "Condition : 6 - The garage shall not be used as habitable accommodation.",
    "Condition : 7 - Full details of the boundary treatment shall be submitted and approved prior to the commencement of the development.  The boundary treatment shall be implemented as approved prior to the occupation of the development."
  ],
